    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαυλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without stalk</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.8.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a feather,
				<i>without shaft</i> or <i>stalk</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				682b18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαυλον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλῖτις</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.107
			</span></i>.</div>
